{title: Jesus, Priceless Treasure}
{artist: Johann Franck · tr. Catherine Winkworth}
{key: Em}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 69}

Verse 1
[Em]Jesus, priceless [B]treasure, [Em]source of purest [B]pleasure, [C]truest [B]friend to [Em]me:
ah, how long I've [B]panted, [Em]and my heart hath [B]fainted, [C]thirsting, [B]Lord, for [Em]thee!
